[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2821.309, "timestamp": "00:47:01", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2825.589, "timestamp": "00:47:05", "text": "不，他用的是他自己的盘子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2828.15, "timestamp": "00:47:08", "text": "乔克喜欢那样。很遗憾，我太"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2831.589, "timestamp": "00:47:11", "text": "听到这个消息我很遗憾。我很遗憾乔克……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2834.309, "timestamp": "00:47:14", "text": "就像那个收车牌的人一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2836.19, "timestamp": "00:47:16", "text": "就像打碎盘子一样"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2836.214, "timestamp": "00:47:16", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "but we enjoy it~"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2838.79, "timestamp": "00:47:18", "text": "那。我的意思是，我知道乔克有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2840.63, "timestamp": "00:47:20", "text": "狂野的一面，但是，哦，等等。我不应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2842.79, "timestamp": "00:47:22", "text": "谈谈这个。是的，乔克真是个很棒的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2844.79, "timestamp": "00:47:24", "text": "可爱又善良，很体贴的男生。何何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2855.51, "timestamp": "00:47:35", "text": "是的，你们的角色都互换了。是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2857.19, "timestamp": "00:47:37", "text": "你，那个穿运动服的小女孩，是"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2865.867, "timestamp": "00:47:45", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "\"cute and kind\""}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2866.309, "timestamp": "00:47:46", "text": "我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2868.23, "timestamp": "00:47:48", "text": "另外，如果你还在上学，请"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2870.272, "timestamp": "00:47:50", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "lmaooooo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2872.15, "timestamp": "00:47:52", "text": "好好享受这段时光吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2874.47, "timestamp": "00:47:54", "text": "除非你读的是中学"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2876.47, "timestamp": "00:47:56", "text": "如果先上学，那就等着上大学吧。"}]